From e35bb17f4f815903bf73598facedbb321e15af28 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: root <root@gbt350-odcdh2-c02-1.png-odc.dcgpu>
Date: Thu, 13 Aug 2026 21:48:08 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] bench: ecfff3fa8 + Lumen swiglu kernels + hipb_mm_mixed
 ported from e42f5791a

ecfff3fa8 is what Lumen origin/main pins, and it is a direct descendant of
the ROCm/aiter 667d6c669 this machine had installed. Its 'clean cherry-pick'
of the Lumen kernels dropped two pieces e42f5791a (the pin recorded in
third_party/aiter) carried, both of which Lumen calls:

  - swiglu_fwd/swiglu_bwd, reached by LUMEN_FUSED_SWIGLU=1 on every arm
  - hipb_mm_mixed, the E4M3xE5M2 wgrad GEMM the hybrid FP8 recipe needs

The .cu half of the mixed GEMM also drops the same-dtype TORCH_CHECK that
made hybrid FP8 die in the first backward.

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
